/v1/","context":{"app_id":2418040,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2418040-1847286114032587","game_id":"steam-2418040","kind":"update","title":"Beyond The Plastic Wall Demo Oct 22 Patch Notes","summary":"Hello from the developers and we hope you are enjoying Next Fest so far! It’s been very valuable reading your feedback and we appreciate everyone who’s taken the time to give it. So we’re doing a bit of clean-up work and releasing this mid-week patch with some adjustments and fixes:Fixed a rare bug where the game could sometimes stop after the third processing maze.Made the textures on some of the interactable elements of the foghorn a bit clearer and brighter so players can more easily discern ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T13:08:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032587","verified_at":"2026-10-22T13:56:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2418040-1846651706690472","game_id":"steam-2418040","kind":"announcement","title":"Beyond the Plastic Wall - live-stream!","summary":"Beyond the Plastic Wall - live-stream!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:20:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690472","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2418040-1846651706689182","game_id":"steam-2418040","kind":"announcement","title":"Beyond the Plastic Wall at Steam Next Fest and more!","summary":"Hi everyone,As you might know, Steam Next Fest is running from October 19th to 26th.And Hal didn’t do the journey empty-handed:Demo with new languages: Spanish and Brazilian Portuguese And new, more fluid animations Try it all out for yourself during this October Next Fest!But that’s not all!Beyond the Plastic Wall satisfying puzzles await you at Paris Games Week, from October 22nd to 25th Come share a part of Hal’s journey, beyond the plastic wall at the ARTE booth!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T08:00:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689182","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2418040-1842212951296131","game_id":"steam-2418040","kind":"announcement","title":"A new demo for Beyond the Plastic Wall is out now.","summary":"Hal's journey to the last city at the end of the world begins again.We've rebuilt the demo from the ground up to make the journey smoother, clearer and more accessible. What's new?Revised and upgraded handling and controlsImproved navigation system In-universe instruction manual with optional puzzle hints Quality-of-life UI updatesUpdated graphics, audio, and animationsImproved performance and stabilityLots of new accessibility features, including optional typefaces, adjustable text size, subtit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T08:08:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951296131","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2418040-1836506165577509","game_id":"steam-2418040","kind":"announcement","title":"The applications are still open for the closed playtest","summary":"Hello everyone ! There are still 3 days left before the application deadline for BTPW closed playtest! Please feel free to participate by filling out this form (it will take 5 minutes): Participate to Beyond the Plastic Wall playtest! (July 10th-22nd) You will have to agree to an NDA, meaning you can’t discuss or stream the game publicly before its release. If you are selected, the playtest begins on the 10th, and from then on, you’ll have as much time as you want to play the game again. The clo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-07T08:58:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165577509","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2418040-1836506165562400","game_id":"steam-2418040","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest applications for Beyond the Plastic Wall are now open!","summary":"Hello everyone! As Beyond the Plastic Wall reaches a new stage of development, we're excited to announce our very first playtest! Applications are open from now until July 9th at 11:59pm. To participate, you'll need to complete an application form and agree to a Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA). This means that you won't be allowed to share or publicly discuss any part of the game before its official release. If you're selected, you'll receive a Steam key to access the playtest. The playtest will ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T12:52:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165562400","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2418040-1835871199315361","game_id":"steam-2418040","kind":"announcement","title":"Explore the First Steps of Hal's Journey – Demo Available Now","summary":"After the warm reception Beyond the Plastic Wall received at A MAZE,we thought the best way to thank you for your support was to share the demo with everyone.(And nooo, you definitely didn't see this demo accidentally shown up before, right? 👀)Whether you missed A MAZE 2026 or simply want to experience it again, now's your chance.Feel free to share your feedback with us so we can make the game even better!Until we meet again, travellers.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T12:05:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199315361","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2418040-1832700592785611","game_id":"steam-2418040","kind":"announcement","title":"Beyond the Plastic Wall Reveal Teaser","summary":"Discover the crumbling world of Beyond the Plastic Wall… We are delighted to reveal the first teaser for Beyond the Plastic Wall and to showcase its demo at A MAZE 2026: What is Beyond the Plastic Wall about?Beyond the Plastic Wall is a pixel art puzzle adventure with a poetic story like you have never played before. You play as Hal, a scavenger who finds a box of letters written by a mysterious woman. So, he decides to set out on a journey to the last city at the end of the world to give it bac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-13T08:00:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592785611","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2418040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:17:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:17:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2418040":"2026-10-26T00:17:42Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2418040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:17:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:17:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4716990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:17:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:17:42Z","status":"ok","